session 26+; generated by `stageK/fxg/g2hlean.py`, numerators from `g2q.py`). Every summand of
the derivative identity of the rational part `formXG2h` is brought to the common denominator
`formXG2Dc = 12X(X - 1)²(X - 2)²K⁴s³(s - 2)³K₂²` (`formXG2H_t…`);
this file treats the summands of the rational part `r₂ = formXJ2r` of the integrand
(`formXG2H_t0`, …, `formXG2H_t8`); the identity itself is `hasDerivAt_formXG2h`
(`SetCKFormXG2H2`).
-/

@[expose] public section

open Real Set

namespace QED.ChainProof.SetCK

/-- The common denominator of the rational identity. -/
noncomputable def formXG2Dc (X s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  12 * X * (X - 1) ^ 2 * (X - 2) ^ 2 * formXK X ^ 4 * s ^ 3 * (s - 2) ^ 3 * formXK2 X s ^ 2

section

